Please note that I have no intention of trying to stop these bounces -
many of them are virtually impossible to reliably trap.

If they bother people, please complain to the originator - Sobig-F
is a virus which uses faked mail from addresses to spread, and as
such, MTAs should _not_ generate bounces for these types of viruses.

